    "updated_at": "2017-04-24T16:31:53Z",
    "body": "For the record, it seems WebKit has:\r\n- No limit on colspan\r\n- A 8190 limit on rowspan \r\n\r\nI do not have strong opinions in terms of which limits should be used. I just think we should choose whatever is easier for all engines to converge on.",
